From 1c9ffcf412b537759f72f16621566ba14b9b3e2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: orangepi-xunlong <258384131@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Jun 2023 09:39:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 27/57] arch: arm64: boot: dts: allwinner: Support Orange Pi
 Zero3

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile        |   1 +
 .../allwinner/sun50i-h616-orangepi-zero3.dts  | 376 +++++++++++
 .../arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616.dtsi | 600 ++++++++++++++++--
